+/// A damaged directory entry: one bit of the oldest cold segment's name flipped ("..._0005"
+/// to "..._0025", '0' to '2'). When the cold TTL prunes that segment, its damaged end becomes
+/// the pruning point in `log_meta.json`, with a valid checksum, and the next open deletes the
